				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>参加できる　ポケモンは
２匹まで　です！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
